---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import ResponsiveImage from '../components/ResponsiveImage.astro';
import data from '../../../../kb/research/collections/tourism-opportunities.json';
import regions from '../../../../kb/research/destinations/regions.json';
const hero=regions.assets[data.hero];
const photos=[...new Set([data.hero,...data.reading.map(item=>item.photo)])].map(id=>regions.assets[id]);
---
<Shell title={data.title} description="Official tourism guidance, cultural reading and ways to contribute local knowledge in Odisha." active="explore" wide related={false}>
<div class="wrap opportunities">
<section class="hero opportunity-hero">
 <div><p class="eyebrow">Ideas for a place with more to share</p><h1>Tourism opportunities<br/><em>in Odisha.</em></h1><p class="lead">{data.intro}</p><p>{data.purpose}</p><a class="utk-button" href="#official-guidance">Find your starting point ↓</a></div>
 <figure class="hero-media"><ResponsiveImage src={hero.src} alt={hero.alt} width={hero.width} height={hero.height} fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>{hero.caption}</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<nav class="opportunity-paths" aria-label="Tourism opportunities sections"><a href="#official-guidance"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span> Understand official support</a><a href="#cultural-reading"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span> Find cultural ideas</a><a href="#contribute"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span> Contribute local knowledge</a></nav>
<section id="official-guidance" class="section">
 <p class="eyebrow">Begin with the rules</p><h2>A possibility starts<br/><em class="highlight">with a clear question.</em></h2>
 <p class="section-intro">Organising an event and investing in a tourism property involve different questions. Odisha Tourism lists separate guidance for each. Choose the relevant document, then check the current conditions with the department.</p>
 <div class="guidance-grid">{data.guidance.map(card=><article class="guidance-card" id={card.id} data-guidance-state={card.application_state}><p class="eyebrow">{card.reader}</p><h3>{card.title}</h3><p>{card.summary}</p><p class="document-date">Notification {card.notification}</p><div class="guidance-action"><p class="limit">{card.limit}</p><a class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" href={card.url}>{card.action} ↗ <span class="file-type">(PDF)</span></a></div></article>)}</div>
 <p class="guidance-context">Official documents checked 8 October 2026. This is an independent reading guide, not a government application service. <a href="https://odishatourism.gov.in/operational-guidelines">See the department’s full guidance list ↗</a></p>
</section>
<section id="cultural-reading" class="section cultural-reading">
 <p class="eyebrow">Give an afternoon a story</p><h2>Come for a reason.<br/><em class="highlight">Leave with a connection.</em></h2>
 <p class="section-intro">Make room for the things that stay with you. These three reading paths connect existing stories and flexible visit ideas. Open a plan to choose and save what interests you.</p>
 <div class="reading-grid">{data.reading.map(item=>{const photo=regions.assets[item.photo];return <article class="reading-card"><figure><ResponsiveImage src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt} width={photo.width} height={photo.height} loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 92vw, 30vw" style="object-fit:contain"/></figure><p class="eyebrow">A flexible reading &amp; visit plan</p><h3><a href={item.href}>{item.title} →</a></h3><p>{item.description}</p></article>})}</div>
 <aside class="planning-note"><h3>Choose the pace. Check the arrangements.</h3><p>These are ideas to research, not confirmed group itineraries or bookable experiences. Check opening arrangements, access, transport and any host agreement before visiting. Each plan keeps its practical questions alongside the stories.</p></aside>
</section>
<section id="contribute" class="invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">Knowledge grows through people</p><h2>What would help<br/><em class="highlight">someone begin?</em></h2></div><div><p>A clearer public source. A corrected place name. A practical question visitors forget to ask. Share the knowledge that could make the next person’s research better.</p><p class="submission-note">Contributions are posted publicly through GitHub Issues and need editorial review. Share public sources and observation dates; leave out personal contact details, identity documents, bank details, guest lists and private correspondence.</p><a class="utk-button" href="/contribute/?page=%2Fopportunities%2F">Prepare a contribution →</a></div></section>
<details class="utk-disclosure sources"><summary>Sources, review limits &amp; photograph credits</summary><p>Project Odisha’s interpretation connects official resources with existing cultural stories. No government endorsement, host partnership or funding award is implied. This page does not determine eligibility, offer legal or financial advice, or guarantee benefits.</p><p><a href="https://odishatourism.gov.in/operational-guidelines">Odisha Tourism operational guidelines</a> (OTX-S03), rows 4 and 5, and the <a href="https://odishatourism.gov.in/odisha-tourism-policy">official policy page</a> (OTX-S10) were checked on 8 October 2026. The guidelines listing date, 4 June 2026, is distinct from the notifications dated 3 June.</p><ul>{data.guidance.map(card=><li><a href={card.url}>{card.title}</a> ({card.source_id}), Department of Tourism, Government of Odisha. Notification {card.notification}. {card.locator} {card.review_extent}</li>)}</ul><p>A matching document does not establish that there are no later amendments. The application flow remains unverified. Cultural plans are desk-researched suggestions with their own source notes; local operating confirmations remain open.</p><h3>Photographs</h3><ul>{photos.map(photo=><li><a href={photo.source}>{photo.caption}</a> · {photo.creator} · <a href={photo.license_url}>{photo.license}</a>. {photo.changes}</li>)}</ul><p>The photographs illustrate places and objects; their inclusion does not imply participation in this initiative.</p></details>
</div>
</Shell>
<style>
.opportunities{padding-bottom:36px}.opportunity-hero{gap:clamp(28px,4vw,72px)}.opportunity-hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,4.6vw,76px);line-height:1.05}.opportunity-hero .lead{font-size:clamp(20px,1.8vw,26px);line-height:1.55}.opportunity-hero .hero-media img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:auto;object-fit:contain}.opportunity-hero figcaption{font-size:13px;padding-block:12px}.opportunities p{line-height:1.7}.opportunity-paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border-block:1px solid var(--line);gap:24px;padding-block:22px}.opportunity-paths a{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:44px;text-underline-offset:5px;font-size:16px}.opportunity-paths span{color:var(--earth);font:italic 28px var(--serif)}.opportunities section[id]{scroll-margin-top:30px}.opportunities h2{font-size:clamp(34px,3.5vw,56px)}.section-intro{max-width:68ch;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:36px}.guidance-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}.guidance-card{background:var(--light);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--earth);padding:clamp(24px,3vw,42px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}.guidance-card h3{font-size:32px;max-width:23ch}.document-date{font-size:13px}.guidance-action{margin-top:auto}.limit{font-size:15px;border-left:2px solid var(--earth);padding-left:16px;margin-block:22px}.file-type{font-size:12px}.guidance-context{max-width:85ch;font-size:14px;margin-top:24px}.cultural-reading{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.reading-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px}.reading-card{min-width:0}.reading-card figure{margin:0 0 22px;background:var(--light)}.reading-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.5;height:auto;display:block}.reading-card h3{font-size:29px;line-height:1.2}.reading-card h3 a{text-decoration:none}.reading-card h3 a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px}.planning-note{margin-top:30px;padding:24px 28px;background:var(--light);border-left:3px solid var(--sea);max-width:90ch}.planning-note h3{font-size:25px}.planning-note p{margin-bottom:0}.submission-note{font-size:14px}.sources{margin-block:40px;font-size:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sources summary{min-height:44px;padding:14px 0;cursor:pointer}.sources h3{font-size:24px}.sources li{margin-block:18px}.sources[open]{max-width:90ch}
@media(max-width:800px){.guidance-grid,.reading-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.opportunity-paths{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;padding-block:14px}.reading-card figure{max-width:640px}.opportunities .section{padding-block:42px}.opportunity-hero{padding-top:28px}.guidance-card h3{max-width:none}.guidance-card .utk-button{white-space:normal;text-align:left}.sources ul{padding-left:20px}}
@media print{.opportunity-paths{display:none}.guidance-card,.reading-card{break-inside:avoid}.guidance-grid,.reading-grid{display:block}}
</style>
